WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.824
This query joins patients with admissions The name
is trimmed repeated

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:11.483
whitespace is collapsed and display case is applied
The email domain

00:00:11.496 --> 00:00:17.222
is extracted from a normalized email Admission time
is reduced to month

00:00:17.236 --> 00:00:24.007
grain Length of stay is converted to numeric days
Read

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:27.152
the query column by column rather than as one large
block
